# Task 01 — Inbox & Priority Triage

## Objective
Show how you triage a busy inbox to reduce response time and escalate priorities correctly.

## Success criteria
- Clear written process (labels, filters, templates)
- Before/after metrics (counts, average response time if available)
- 3–5 email templates for common queries
- `deliverable.md` and screenshots or exported email CSV

## Suggested tools
Gmail/Outlook, Google Sheets, Notion, Labels/Filters, canned responses

## Deliverables
- /samples/task-01/deliverable.md (process + metrics)
- sample templates: `reply-template-1.md`, `reply-template-2.md`
- optional: `inbox-snapshot-before.png`, `inbox-snapshot-after.png`

